      "has_readme": true,
      "readme_length": 5061,
      "readme_excerpt": "# Zellij Claude Plugin\n\nA Zellij plugin that provides seamless integration with Claude, Anthropic's AI assistant. Launch Claude panes and send messages directly through Zellij's pipe interface.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Launch or Focus**: Automatically launches a new Claude pane or focuses an existing one\n- **Send Messages**: Send messages to Claude programmatically via pipe commands\n\n## Installation\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- [Zellij](https://github.com/zellij-org/zellij) terminal multiplexer\n- [Claude CLI](https://claude.ai/download) installed and in your PATH\n- Rust toolchain with `wasm32-wasip1` target\n\n### Building from Source\n\n```bash\n# Clone the repository\ngit clone https://github.com/715d/zellij-claude.git\ncd zellij-claude\n\n# Add WASM target if not already installed\nrustup target add wasm32-wasip1\n\n# Build the plugin\ncargo build --release --target wasm32-wasip1\n```\n\nThe compiled plugin will be at `target/wasm32-wasip1/release/zellij-claude.wasm`\n\n### Installing the Plugin\n\n#### Option 1: Download from GitHub Releases\n\nDue to GitHub's authentication requirements, you need to download the plugin first:\n\n```bash\n# Download latest release\nwget https://github.com/715d/zellij-claude/releases/",
